## Dates, Deadlines and More

Every election is governed by critical deadlines that must be met. From candidate filing, the start of vote-by-mail voting or the last day to register to vote – we’ve assembled all of these important dates in one location that you can view, or print.  
[View the 2026 General Election Condensed Calendar](https://ocvote.gov/sites/default/files/2026-07/Condensed%20Calendar%2011.3.2026_0.pdf)  
[View the 2026 General Election Extended Calendar](https://ocvote.gov/sites/default/files/2026-07/Extended%20Calendar%20for%202026%20General.pdf)  
[View the 2026 General Election OC Districts Calendar](https://ocvote.gov/sites/default/files/2026-06/OC%20Districts%20Measure%20Calendar.pdf)  
[View the 2026 General Election OC Cities Measures Calendar](https://ocvote.gov/sites/default/files/2026-06/OC%20Cities%20Measures%20Calendar.pdf)  
[View the 2026 General Election County Measures Calendar](https://ocvote.gov/sites/default/files/2026-06/County%20Measures%20Calendar.pdf)

